      "created_at": "2024-06-25T09:29:25.679Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I experienced the same on V15 on Frappe Cloud.</p>\n<p>The closing balance of certain accounts in the Trial Balance report are different from the closing balances of the same accounts in the General Ledger report.</p>\n<p>I have raised it as an issue on GitHub:<br>\n<strong><a href=\"https://github.com/frappe/erpnext/issues/41986\" class=\"inline-onebox\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Account Balance in Trial Balance Report Does Not Match Balance in General Ledger · Issue #41986 · frappe/erpnext · GitHub</a></strong></p>",
