      "id": 480910,
      "username": "Maveez",
      "name": "Maveez MH",
      "created_at": "2025-09-17T05:00:49.333Z",
      "cooked": "<p>its due to change in method of trial balance calculation… if the previous fiscal years are not closed the trial balance wont show properly in v15. either close the accounting fiscal year by creating period closing vouher. or in settings use checkbox provided to use legacy trial balance method.</p>\n<p>it is recommended to close period and use new enhancement</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/a/4/a4048dd832afd7a9bf65125e2993f07c28779204.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/a4048dd832afd7a9bf65125e2993f07c28779204\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/4/a4048dd832afd7a9bf65125e2993f07c28779204_2_690x333.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"noY3Rc3y6tWLnTi2SWFq0wFreBu\" width=\"690\" height=\"333\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/4/a4048dd832afd7a9bf65125e2993f07c28779204_2_690x333.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/4/a4048dd832afd7a9bf65125e2993f07c28779204_2_1035x499.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/4/a4048dd832afd7a9bf65125e2993f07c28779204_2_1380x666.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F9F9F9\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">2030×982 90.8 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
